// This file is NOT included by Xcode automatically — it is a template for values you may paste into
// `StripeKeys.xcconfig` (or keep locally as notes). The OnCutsiOS target only reads `StripeKeys.xcconfig`
// as its base configuration.
//
// For Stripe test mode: set STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = pk_test_… in `StripeKeys.xcconfig`, then
// Product → Clean Build Folder.

// STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = pk_test_your_publishable_key
// Optional Apple Pay (wired via `GoogleSignInURL.plist` → `StripeApplePayMerchantId`; enable Apple Pay on the target):
// STRIPE_APPLE_PAY_MERCHANT_ID = merchant.com.your.app
// STRIPE_APPLE_PAY_MERCHANT_COUNTRY_CODE = US
